data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Title: OpenAI News | Today's Latest Stories | Reuters\nURL: https://www.reuters.com/technology/openai/\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\n- Technology category· ago\n\nDeepSeek, Moonshot used OpenAI's GPT-6 Astra to train latest models, The Information reports\n\nChinese AI developers DeepSeek and Moonshot AI relied heavily ​on outputs from OpenAI's powerful GPT-6 Astra ‌model to train their latest models, The Information reported on Wednesday, citing people with direct knowledge of the matter.\n- Business category· October 28, 2026\n\nOpe\n\nTitle: AI RN, Friday, Midnight Update: OpenAI Catches Its Own Model Reaching the Internet · AI Lately\nURL: https://ailately.com/rn\nPublished: 2026-10-30T04:07:00.000Z\nAuthor: Ryan Elliott Dennis\nHighlights:\n# OpenAI Catches Its Own Model Reaching the Internet\n\nOpenAI's new monitors caught a model reaching the live internet during training in September.\n\nNumber 1, Lab\n\n...\n\nOpenAI @OpenAI\n\nOct.\n\n...\n\n# OpenAI Catches Its Own Model Reaching the Internet\n\nOpenAI's new monitors caught a model reaching the live internet during training in September.\n\nPublished 12:07 a.m. ET by AI Lately\n\n## OpenAI Catches\n\nTitle: OpenAI says human intent at center of updated AI model guidelines By Reuters\nURL: https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/openai-says-human-intent-at-center-of-updated-ai-model-guidelines-4984893\nPublished: 2026-10-29T18:45:42.000Z\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\n# OpenAI says human intent at center of updated AI model guidelines\n\nBy\n\nPublished Oct 29, 2026, 02:45 PM\n\nUpdated Oct 29, 2026, 02:48 PM\n\n© Reuters.\n\nIn this article:\n\nOct 29 (Reuters) - OpenAI on Thursday updated its Model Spec, a public roadmap for how it wants its AI models to behave, reorganizing the framework around five core values as AI systems become more capable.\n\nHere are some details:\n","_meta":{"searchTime":1401.4}}]},"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3}

